Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.58,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:46.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate\Nthe face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,When our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,On your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.87,0:01:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.65,0:01:34.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Berlin : a city where corruption and revival coexist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.65,0:01:39.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Here lies one of the few International\Ncities that was a target for missile attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.95,0:01:45.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in both the nuclear Third World War\Nand the conventional Fourth World War.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:49.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even so, this city, which holds special\Nsignificance for the Germanic people,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.95,0:01:53.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,has succeeded in completing a dramatic revival each time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.75,0:01:58.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,renewing itself as the nation's capital three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:11.30,Sign - Copy,,500,0,500,,{\b1}Angel's \N Poem{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:34.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even Kyo-Re's 3003 model thermo-optical\Ncamouflage can't deceive a dog's sense of smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.18,0:02:36.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are you doing, Batou?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:39.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stop screwing around if you don't want to mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:40.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry, couldn't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:44.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm not really suited to these long\Nsurveillance missions in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:47.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Besides, this snow makes things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.47,0:02:50.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It reduces the effectiveness of the thermo-optical camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.37,0:02:55.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There aren't that many people who are cut out for these missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.87,0:03:04.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's finish up and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:07.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They'll reach a conclusion in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:09.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou, I'm signing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:14.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This line may be tapped, even though it's an encrypted transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:16.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get back to your post soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:18.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:37.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even with all my sensory functions\Nturned off, the cold still gets to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:43.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm surprised you got here in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.03,0:03:46.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Was there a direct flight from Taiwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.13,0:03:51.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I first made a stop in Hong Kong and had them \N give me a seat on the first flight here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.13,0:03:56.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm surprised that we're attempting to\Nbag such big game with a mixed team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:03:58.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:04.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When I heard about the mission from the Chief, \N I actually thought he was joking for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:07.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well. Angel Wing is a major terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:12.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's been targeting the leaders of developed \N nations while they're attending summits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:19.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They might have settled on this capture strategy \N as a way to let each nation look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:23.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And you and I got picked for the dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.63,0:04:26.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The timing of a mission overseas right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:30.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I think it's safe to assume that the \N Cabinet Intelligence Agency recommended us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:41.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:44.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,First, I'd like you to take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.92,0:04:47.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This man's name is Angelica.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:50.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's a full cyborg and a self professed commissions agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's a Dutch citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:55.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It has also become apparent that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.22,0:04:59.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he's the one we know as Angel Wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:04.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This terrorist is responsible for the worst \N single attack in history, in terms of victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:05.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What proof do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:09.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And what was this attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:12.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll get to that in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:17.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Angel Wing's ideology and style are consistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:21.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He is opposed to the fact\Nthat a select few advanced
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:24.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,nations monopolise\Ndecision-making on global issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:27.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Therefore, he announced that he would \N set off bombs in glass-sheathed skyscrapers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:31.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,somewhere in each nation where the summits would be held.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:37.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He earned his name from the fact that he \N generated more victims by raining glass shards
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:38.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,from the explosion on the people below.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:46.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,While the host nations were on high alert because of his threats,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:49.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they still could not prevent all the attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:51.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,since each one might occur anywhere in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:55.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The investigating authorities\Nthen tried to ascertain his
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:59.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,appearance from the IR system\Nlogs in each building he attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:02.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, as a complete cyborg, he wore a different face every time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:05.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,effectively becoming a completely different individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:11.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is why Angel Wing's true identity remains unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:15.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If that's the case, how did you reach the conclusion that\Nhe is a complete cyborg and not just a face-swapper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:19.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Two months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.64,0:06:24.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,a physician in the Netherlands, who specialises \N in cyborgs, accidentally put a man in a coma
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:28.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,during an operation to swap his cybernetic body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:31.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Several memories were found in this person
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:34.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that seemed to indicate that the man was Angel Wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.44,0:06:37.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,According to the Dutch physician,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:44.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,specific details about the terrorist bombings the man had committed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:47.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and facial data of the bodies he switched to afterward,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:50.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,were found among the memories extracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:56.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do the IR logs from the attack site confirm this facial data?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All of the faces were present.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:05.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After wrestling for a few days with the inherent\Nethical problems involved in turning over this data,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:08.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the physician reported his findings to the local police.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.14,0:07:11.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If only he'd reported it earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:14.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's true, but we can't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.74,0:07:16.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So we know this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:20.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,With this data, why were we called to Berlin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:23.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,instead of to Leeds, where the summit will be held next month?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.24,0:07:26.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:33.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The authorities checked this man's past \N facial data against IR systems in airports worldwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:41.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was discovered that Angel Wing \N always stop here in Berlin before an attack
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:45.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and then, two days before the attack date, \N departs from Tegel International Airport
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.18,0:07:47.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to his destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:53.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For the Shanghai Summit in 2028, he departed February 17th;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:59.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,for the Moscow Summit in 2029, November 25th;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:04.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and for the Paris Summit in 2030, July 13th.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:06.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These dates all follow the "two days prior" pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:11.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For some reason, he has repeated the same pattern three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:15.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Considering that Angel Wing had shown \N no other routine behaviour except his attack method,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:18.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,this seems like a very unusual pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:21.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What route does he use to come to Berlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:23.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is unknown,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:30.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but for some reason, he always came \N through Berlin before his attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:34.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Therefore, it is probable that he'll \N be here in Berlin again for a few days
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:38.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,before the upcoming summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:43.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,During this time, we can assume that he'll be \N using the same cybernetic body as the one in this data.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:48.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is the first real chance we've had to catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:50.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,During the time that he's here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:54.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we will do whatever it takes to find and collar him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.44,0:08:58.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And this is how we'll accomplish that, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:02.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It makes me want to quit this mission already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:10.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems I just don't get along with dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:23.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That girl again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.11,0:09:26.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where does she keep going at this time of the day, alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:28.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,not to mention in the snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.57,0:10:06.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All units, this is a routine sector check.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.17,0:10:07.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Confirming sectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:08.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Report status.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.77,0:10:11.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is D1. No sign of target.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:13.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Situation normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:17.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is D2. No sign of target.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:19.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Possibility of infiltration is nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.07,0:10:25.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is D3. No sign of target.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.17,0:10:26.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Situation normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:31.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is D4. No sign of target and situation normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.37,0:10:32.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:35.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Continue surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.37,0:10:39.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The operation will end in two days, regardless of the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.97,0:10:42.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If Angel Wing does not appear,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:45.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the operation will be transferred to the Leeds authorities,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:48.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and the investigation will revert to\Nthe pursuit of a faceless terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.47,0:10:52.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Be vigilant; we must acquire the target in\Nthis window of opportunity at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.87,0:10:54.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.66,0:10:57.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,D4, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:10:59.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:21.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's just not a mission I'm suited for, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.35,0:11:37.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Transparent Monster Sighted in Stations and at the Airport"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.25,0:11:41.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems I'm not the only one bored around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.92,0:11:51.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Asian refugees announced Dejima as an autonomous region in Japan."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:54.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I guess things are getting hairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:02.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's with that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.17,0:12:04.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Does she know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.78,0:12:07.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if she does, I have no idea why she should.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.59,0:12:53.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Angel, why is it that Papa hasn't shown up yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.79,0:12:55.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,when his mail came two weeks ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.49,0:12:57.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Papa"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:06.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But I do feel his presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.96,0:13:09.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He must have another errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:15.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:18.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She's perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:20.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:49.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,An orphanage...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.41,0:14:21.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So she could see me from here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.47,0:14:47.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Angel, I've always told Papa that there's nothing I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:49.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but this time I do want something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.07,0:14:54.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sure Papa will come back again, with a different body this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:57.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:02.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Theresia, could you come downstairs for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.77,0:15:03.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:21.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.73,0:15:24.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:27.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll come see you within two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.13,0:15:28.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's meet at the usual church.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.33,0:15:31.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No specific date, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:51.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry, but I have to take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.05,0:15:59.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Talk about bad handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:03.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"July 12th, 2030.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.30,0:16:04.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Papa came tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:07.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Met at the church chapel."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:14.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"November 24th, 2029.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:16.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Papa came back as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:18.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Christmas one month early.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:23.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The present I got at the church was a cashmere coat."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.04,0:16:32.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"February 11th, 2028.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:35.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Suddenly got a message from Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:38.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Met at the church chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:40.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Got mittens as a present."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It fits!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.14,0:16:46.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These dates are all the day before Angelica leaves Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:51.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:58.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"The code word for when I don't recognise\NPapa because he has changed his body:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:02.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"What is the angel going to do today?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.66,0:17:05.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"I'm going to rain angel feathers throughout the world."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:10.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then this means that that girl's father... is Angel Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.28,0:17:42.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All units, this is a routine sector check.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.29,0:17:44.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Confirming sectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:46.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Report status.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.59,0:17:48.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is D1. No sign of target.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.79,0:17:50.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Possibility of infiltration is nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.89,0:17:52.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is D2. No sign of target.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.69,0:17:54.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Possibility of infiltration is nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.79,0:17:56.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is D3. No sign of target.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:17:58.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Situation normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.79,0:18:01.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,D4, why have you changed position?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.29,0:18:04.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, there were a lot of stray dogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:07.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even the 3003 model has no effect on their sense of smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:10.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Report if you're going to change position.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.79,0:18:12.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Upon confirmation, we'll issue orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:13.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:03.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you trying to atone for having killed many innocents?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.53,0:19:08.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:19.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Angelica!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:22.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I know you're Angel Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.45,0:19:23.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.35,0:19:25.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:26.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.55,0:19:27.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's no point denying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:29.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We have definite proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.05,0:19:32.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why else would the police be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.85,0:19:33.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:39.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even after taking the lives of many because of your selfish ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:42.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,you still want to be a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.85,0:19:46.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There must have been mothers, and children waiting for presents
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:49.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,at every site where you destroyed buildings\Nand rained glass on your victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:53.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you think you can be with your daughter\Nand act as if nothing has happened
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:56.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,after taking so many lives, you're sadly mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.75,0:20:01.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's too bad, but you'll never see your daughter again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.25,0:20:04.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.35,0:20:05.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.75,0:20:11.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You know my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.95,0:20:14.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have a request to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.15,0:20:16.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you know her,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.15,0:20:18.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,can you give her that package?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.25,0:20:22.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's something she really wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.10,0:20:52.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:00.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When did you turn into a saint?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.10,0:21:03.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I thought about just watching you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:03.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but you're getting sloppy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.70,0:21:05.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:07.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:12.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I couldn't put a ghost invasion key on\Nyou like I did on Togusa, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:15.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So I tapped your visual receptors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:17.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.70,0:21:21.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You missed it during the encoded transmission yesterday. Sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.90,0:21:25.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The operation is over
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:28.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,once we notify HQ and bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:30.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's go back to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:42.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:44.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is it you, Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.26,0:21:45.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There was a loud noise just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:47.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:51.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You... weren't able to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.16,0:21:52.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.56,0:21:54.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.76,0:21:59.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's you right, Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:01.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.96,0:22:03.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:08.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Papa, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:10.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please answer me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.86,0:22:12.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, you're there right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:15.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.56,0:22:18.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is the angel going to do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.86,0:22:23.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is the angel going to do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.66,0:22:27.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The angel...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.26,0:22:30.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.86,0:22:33.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The angel...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.06,0:22:38.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,won't...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.36,0:22:43.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,won't be going anywhere anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:10.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.46,0:23:14.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:17.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.36,0:23:21.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.16,0:23:25.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.66,0:23:28.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:32.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.16,0:23:34.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:36.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.59,0:23:38.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:39.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.87,0:23:41.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.53,0:23:43.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.13,0:23:46.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is right)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:47.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.56,0:23:48.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.11,0:23:51.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.10,0:23:49.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.98,0:23:54.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.50,0:23:55.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:57.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.47,0:23:58.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.89,0:23:59.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.87,0:24:01.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.45,0:24:03.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.87,0:24:05.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.15,0:24:08.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.46,0:24:07.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.43,0:24:12.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.65,0:24:10.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.85,0:24:13.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.97,0:24:15.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.27,0:24:16.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:16.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,all I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.52,0:24:19.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.82,0:24:22.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.67,0:24:25.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
